---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Layanan Kami — Joyo Digitama Solusi"
  description="Pengembangan software kustom, aplikasi mobile, solusi cloud, rekayasa database, integrasi IoT, dan layanan integrasi sistem."
  path="services"
  lang="id"
>
  <!-- Hero Halaman -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-tag" style="margin-bottom:24px;display:block;">// layanan kami</span>
      <h1>Layanan <span class="phosphor">Kami</span></h1>
      <p>Layanan pengembangan software dan transformasi digital menyeluruh untuk industri modern</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Grid Layanan -->
  <section style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon green"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6" /><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18" /></svg></div>
          <h2>Pengembangan Software Kustom</h2>
          <p>Aplikasi web, software desktop, dan pengembangan API yang disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan bisnis Anda. Kami membangun solusi yang scalable dan mudah dirawat dengan tech stack modern.</p>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag green">React</span>
            <span class="tag green">Python</span>
            <span class="tag green">Next.js</span>
            <span class="tag green">Hono</span>
            <span class="tag green">TypeScript</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon blue"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2" /><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18" /></svg></div>
          <h2>Pengembangan Aplikasi Mobile</h2>
          <p>Solusi mobile native dan cross-platform untuk iOS dan Android. Dari konsep hingga publikasi di app store.</p>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag blue">Kotlin</span>
            <span class="tag blue">React Native</span>
            <span class="tag blue">Flutter</span>
            <span class="tag blue">Swift</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon purple"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 10h-1.26A8 8 0 1 0 9 20h9a5 5 0 0 0 0-10z" /></svg></div>
          <h2>Solusi Cloud</h2>
          <p>Migrasi cloud, otomatisasi DevOps, dan desain arsitektur microservices. Optimalkan infrastruktur Anda untuk performa dan efisiensi biaya.</p>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag purple">AWS</span>
            <span class="tag purple">Azure</span>
            <span class="tag purple">Google Cloud</span>
            <span class="tag purple">Cloudflare</span>
            <span class="tag purple">Docker</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon orange"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3" /><path d="M21 12c0 1.66-4 3-9 3s-9-1.34-9-3" /><path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5" /></svg></div>
          <h2>Solusi Database</h2>
          <p>Desain database, optimasi performa, migrasi, dan strategi backup. Kami memastikan infrastruktur data Anda tangguh dan scalable.</p>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag orange">PostgreSQL</span>
            <span class="tag orange">MySQL</span>
            <span class="tag orange">SQL Server</span>
            <span class="tag orange">SQLite</span>
            <span class="tag orange">Redis</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon amber"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" /><path d="M12 1v2M12 21v2M4.22 4.22l1.42 1.42M18.36 18.36l1.42 1.42M1 12h2M21 12h2M4.22 19.78l1.42-1.42M18.36 5.64l1.42-1.42" /></svg></div>
          <h2>Integrasi IoT</h2>
          <p>Integrasi sensor, monitoring real-time, dan solusi otomasi industri. Hubungkan aset fisik Anda dengan kecerdasan digital.</p>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag amber">MQTT</span>
            <span class="tag amber">LoRaWAN</span>
            <span class="tag amber">Modbus</span>
            <span class="tag amber">OPC-UA</span>
            <span class="tag amber">GPIO</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon rose"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" /><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12" /><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z" /></svg></div>
          <h2>Integrasi Sistem</h2>
          <p>Integrasi ERP, pengembangan API, dan modernisasi sistem legacy. Jembatani sistem yang sudah ada dengan teknologi terbaru.</p>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag rose">REST APIs</span>
            <span class="tag rose">GraphQL</span>
            <span class="tag rose">Middleware</span>
            <span class="tag rose">Webhooks</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon green"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z" /><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8" /><line x1="9" y1="13" x2="15" y2="13" /><line x1="9" y1="17" x2="13" y2="17" /></svg></div>
          <h2>Content Management Systems</h2>
          <p>CMS kustom yang dibangun dengan benar &mdash; bukan ketergantungan pada page-builder. Alur kerja editorial, konten terstruktur, dan landing page yang tim Anda bisa publikasikan tanpa developer. Headless maupun monolitik, cepat dan siap SEO.</p>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag green">Headless CMS</span>
            <span class="tag green">Strapi</span>
            <span class="tag green">Sanity</span>
            <span class="tag green">WordPress</span>
            <span class="tag green">Next.js</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-section bracket-box reveal">
        <h2>Siap Memulai Proyek Anda?</h2>
        <p>Mari diskusikan bagaimana kami dapat membantu digitalisasi operasional Anda dengan tech stack yang tepat.</p>
        <a href="/id/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
          Hubungi Kami
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"
            ><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" /></svg
          >
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
